# Best Time to Buy and Sell Stock

Approach

Step 1
Initialize minimum price as the first day's price.

Step 2
Traverse the array from left to right.

Step 3
Calculate today's profit = current price - minimum price.

Step 4
Update the maximum profit.

Step 5
Update the minimum price if the current price is smaller.

Time Complexity
O(n)

Space Complexity
O(1)